      "block_id": "2605.00155_p38_b0",
      "text": "DRO and DRRO in operations research.\nStandard DRO protects decisions against\nambiguity in probabilities, distributions, and objective coefficients. Ben-Tal et al. [2013]\nstudy robust solutions under uncertain probabilities, Wiesemann et al. [2014] provide a\ngeneral convex-optimization framework, Mohajerin Esfahani and Kuhn [2018] develop\n",
      "bbox": [
        72.0,
        74.68,
        523.68,
        140.36
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        288,
        298,
        2094,
