      "font_size": 11.84,
      "font_name": "LMRoman12-Bold",
      "is_math": false,
      "char_count": 339,
      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p38_b1",
      "text": "data-driven Wasserstein DRO, Blanchet and Murthy [2019] quantify distributional model\nrisk, and Rahimian and Mehrotra [2019] survey the area. The concern that worst-case\nvalue may be overly conservative leads naturally to regret-based robustness. Averbakh\n[2004] and Averbakh and Lebedev [2005] develop classical minmax-regret models and\ncomplexity results; Chen and Xie [2021] study regret in the newsvendor problem; and\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.7,
        146.38,
        523.35,
        230.0
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
        286,
        585,
        2093,
