      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p38_b5",
      "text": "The KL term should nevertheless be interpreted carefully, because it remains a common\nreference point in RLHF. For a suitable multiplier \u03b7, the penalized formulation is the\nLagrangian form of the trust-region problem\n",
      "bbox": [
        71.58,
        382.63,
        523.29,
